<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koetai/biodiversity-fdp/main/fdp/biodiversity-index/> a <http://www.re3data.org/schema/3-0#Repository>,
        fdp-o:MetadataService ;
    dcterms:description "Static FAIR Data Point index over biodiversity infrastructures. Each sub-catalog describes one resource and lists every way to obtain it: native portal and APIs, bulk files, cloud buckets and copies in aggregators (GBIF, QLever, Koetai). Provenance is preserved, not deduplicated: the iNaturalist subset in GBIF appears under both."@en ;
    dcterms:identifier "https://koetai.github.io/biodiversity-fdp/",
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koetai/biodiversity-fdp/main/fdp/biodiversity-index/" ;
